      "title": "Transfer Agent Rules",
      "document_number": "2026-18190",
      "publication_date": "2026-09-04",
      "type": "Proposed Rule",
      "abstract": "The U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (\"SEC\" or \"Commission\") is proposing to adopt new rules, amend existing rules, amend the existing form for registration with the Commission as a transfer agent (Form TA-1) and the existing form for reporting activities of transfer agents (Form TA-2), and rescind an existing rule governing registered transfer agents. The proposals are designed to modernize the rules governing registered transfer agents.",
